      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In July of 1962, My Executive Order announced the installation of a unified direct dialing system known as Centrex. Since that time 31irty-six departments have been cut over to this system. In June of this year, the second phase of the Centrex installation will be cut over to serve many more City departments and agencies.",
