      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The Department of Public Works has been assigned the responsibility of preparing a schedule of instructions for all employees in the Phase II operation not over. Lectures will be conducted by the Telephone Company on the operation of this new equipment. Each lecture will last about one hour and all of the personnel in these departments must attend to insure the complete success of this change in our communication system.",
